{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねると鎌倉に行ってきたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFCYCVA0GGWDB1CGSESY5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n久しぶりの海でテンション上がりました✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たそがれ ねるちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFDZWMZK05KHPHYXY0KQP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n可愛いなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねるが撮ってくれた〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFEZH71NRYA7MDXN4MB6F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすが 元写真部📷\nクオリティ高い〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗でした!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFG06GBF9MM8WQ8HGYEWV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"油断して砂浜を歩いていたら、ねるの靴が波にのまれて海水につかっちゃってました(笑)\n私は逃げ切りました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、旅しようね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}